# Heavy media - stays local; docs, scripts and small images are tracked
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mov
docs/final-sprint/promo/clips/
docs/final-sprint/promo/final/
docs/final-sprint/promo/_archive/

# Real-CV corpus: the hash->filename map is the one artifact that can identify
# a person, because collected CVs are named after their authors. The corpus
# itself lives outside the repo; this keeps its name map out too.
docs/final-sprint/outputs/metrics-raw/*.local.json

# humanize skill: plain text extracted from .docx for linting
*.extracted.txt

# Submission materials live outside the repo (policy 2026-08-22): the repo carries
# only code, DS notebooks and run-critical data. The book, design assets and
# marketing/demo media are delivered separately.
docs/progect_book/
docs/design/
docs/final-sprint/promo/
docs/final-sprint/outputs/marketing/
docs/final-sprint/outputs/metrics-raw/
docs/final-sprint/outputs/video/
demo_screenshots/
test-fixtures/download-verification/

# Colab download copies of the M06 retrain notebook (executed outputs, ~8MB).
# The canonical trainer is ds/final/model1_retrain.ipynb.
ds/model/archive/model1_retrain*.ipynb
